src/screens/admin/AdminSuccessScreen.tsx.fix:
Navigate immediately and refresh in the background with an in-flight guard:

```tsx
const submitting = useRef(false);
const handleEnterDashboard = () => {
  if (submitting.current) return;
  submitting.current = true;
  // useEffect already refreshed auth in the background; don't block navigation on the network
  refreshUser().catch(() => {});
  navigation.reset({ index: 0, routes: [{ name: 'Main' }] });
};
```
Drop `async`/`await` so the reset is never gated behind a hanging request.

src/screens/admin/AdminBannerScreen.tsx.fix:
Use the absolute target for both the request and the state update, and add an in-flight/failure path:

const handleToggleActive = async (banner: BannerItem) => {
  const next = !banner.isActive;
  const success = await bannerService.updateBanner(banner.id, { isActive: next });
  if (success) {
    setBanners(prev => prev.map(b => b.id === banner.id ? { ...b, isActive: next } : b));
  } else {
    Alert.alert(t('common.error'), t('admin.banner.updateFailed', { defaultValue: 'Failed to update banner' }));
  }
};

